   6| 
   7| ## R1 -- the GATE 2 block moves BELOW the compiler detection and receives the gate's `$CC` (drafter #2 / D-9)
   8| 
   9| Facts (HEAD `regress/gate_offline.sh`): `:183-184` `command -v cc ... || command -v gcc ... || gate_skip "no C
  10| compiler on PATH"`; `:185` `CC=$(command -v cc || command -v gcc)`; the `#406` autodev block (the other generator
