  16|   immediately BEFORE `# ---- #412: SCSI READ CAPACITY on a zero-block disk` (HEAD `:1929`), i.e. right after the
  17|   `#406` block's closing `fi` and blank line.  Content unchanged except the invocation line, which becomes:
  18| 
