  45|       cpu_m88k_instr.c).  */
  46|   ->
  47|       They were NULL,
  48|       and their consumers index the table unguarded --
  49|       xmem_slow() calls the slot, the register-form
  50|       ld/st decoder installs it as ic->f (both in
  51|       cpu_m88k_instr.c) -- so none of the 24 may be
  52|       NULL, whether or not an instruction reaches it
